  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wanawake Sasa!   Strengthening Women and Girls&#x2019; Participation in Civic and Democratic Processes in Tanzania.: This project will specifically seek to enhance the participation of women and girls in the upcoming elections through provision of civic education and training of female aspirant leaders. The partner will also engage key governance institutions and stakeholders to advocate for the enabling environment for inclusion and gender equality.</narrative>
